+        // not change that on this hardware, so the write-back races the
+        // buffer's unlock/teardown and the GPU faults (page not present,
+        // write from TC -- confirmed on 7.14 and 10.0; a plain compute
+        // kernel writing the same buffer is clean). Route through the staged
